<title>USA: Atmos Energy rate increase cleared.</title>
<headline>Atmos Energy rate increase cleared.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atmos Energy Corp said Tuesday it received approval from the Railroad Commission of Texas to implement a $599,000 rate increase in certain unincorporated areas in West Texas, effective April 1, for a total increase of $5.7 million in its West Texas system.</p>
<p>The company also said it will locate its central customer support call center in Amarillo, Texas.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to have the call center operational by early 1998.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
